<title>UK: Tuapse pipeline repair set for April 11-13 - sources.</title>
<headline>Tuapse pipeline repair set for April 11-13 - sources.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The pipeline supplying Russian Black Sea oil terminal Tuapse will close for two days around April 11-13 for scheduled maintenance, shipping sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Tuapse exports fuel oil, gas oil and Urals crude.</p>
<p>The sources said the closure of the Transneft line was not expected to disrupt loadings.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
